    "Batty is using %@ across %lld Terminal Sessions. Close some to free memory." : {
      "comment" : "Bell Feed / system-notification body for the memory footprint soft-limit warning (#0290). Pluralized on the Terminal Session count. Manually added like the other BattyKit strings above (BattyKit's String(localized:) calls aren't auto-extracted into this catalog) -- see #0295. All 15 locales carry the same English text for now (non-en marked needs_review) so every locale applies its own CLDR plural rule to get correct singular/plural grammar; actual translation of the sentence is separate future work.",
